<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When darkness veils His lovely face,</l><l>I rest on His unchanging grace;</l><l>In every high and stormy gale,</l><l>My anchor holds within the veil.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>His oath, His covenant, His blood,</l><l>Support me in the whelming flood;</l><l>When all around my soul gives way,</l><l>He then is all my hope and stay.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>When He shall come with trumpet sound,</l><l>Oh, may I then in Him be found;</l><l>In Him, my righteousness, alone,</l><l>Faultless to stand before the throne.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
